                  "evidence": [
                    "方案选项 stop-report-derived-findings：Change only storyloop/stop_report.py. Add a new private helper, _review_findings(state, details). It reads the source in this order: details['findings'], then state['findings'], then state['planning']['consistency']['findings']. It keeps only dict items with blocking is True and maps each to {target, severity:'阻塞', location, message}. Location and message go through processutil.redact first and are then cut with processutil.redaction_prefix, so that all string fields together stay ≤284 characters (each rendered line then stays ≤300). build_stop adds 'review_findings' only when status == 'DESIGN_REVISION_REQUIRED' and the list is non-empty. stop_of handles a saved DESIGN_REVISION_REQUIRED stop that lacks the key (the legacy case) by returning a new dict {**saved, 'review_findings': derived}, without saving and without changing run. render_stop prints a '方案阻塞意见：' section, one line per item in the form '  - [<target>/<severity>] <location>：<message>'. This section sits after evidence/facts/questions and before '可选操作：'. The run, status and log callers already go through build_stop/stop_of/render_stop, so none of them change.（全文：.storyloop/state/runs/FIX-20261105-design-revision-findings.json → planning.plan）",
                    "涉及文件：storyloop/stop_report.py、tests/test_design_revision_findings.py",
                    "Risks：sensitive: yes、migration: no、external_contract: yes、new_interface: yes、crosscut: yes、principle_deviation: no、hard_verify_high_cost: no、dependency_swap: no；共 11 项，完整内容见 .storyloop/state/runs/FIX-20261105-design-revision-findings.json → planning.plan",
                    "Decisions：1. **Choice:** Compute everything in one new private helper, `_review_findings(state, details)`, in stop_report.py. **Rationale:** run, status and log must produce the same list (AC-2), and stop_report is the place they all share. **Alternatives considered:** changing pause/consistency to pre-build the list. That would not cover legacy stops and would spread the change across more files. 2. **Choi…完整内容见 .storyloop/state/runs/FIX-20261105-design-revision-findings.json → planning.plan"
                  ],
